  "fylite:case": {
    "fylite:name": "JINTRAC 5 MA L-mode · 芯—边耦合（本仓跑不动；源里也没跑完）",
    "fylite:name_en": "JINTRAC 5 MA L-mode - core-edge coupling (this repository cannot run it; nor did the source finish it)",
    "fylite:needs": [
      "SOL / 偏滤器的二维等离子体流体输运（EDGE2D 那一档）——本仓没有",
      "蒙特卡洛中性粒子与原子分子过程（EIRENE）——本仓没有",
      "芯—边交换与同步（COCONUT）——本仓没有"
    ],
    "fylite:needs_en": [
      "Two-dimensional plasma-fluid transport in the SOL and divertor (EDGE2D) -- this repository has none",
      "Monte-Carlo neutrals and atomic/molecular processes (EIRENE) -- none",
      "Core-edge exchange and synchronization (COCONUT) -- none"
    ],
    "fylite:source": "《Progress of JINTRAC Deployment on the ASIPP Cluster》Xiaojuan Liu, 2026-08-28（Test Case Matrix）",
    "fylite:source_en": "'Progress of JINTRAC Deployment on the ASIPP Cluster', Xiaojuan Liu, 2026-08-28 (Test Case Matrix)",
    "fylite:reference": {
      "fylite:note": "源文档「5 MA L-mode — core/edge/divertor state」最后一帧的表值。★这是**边界的**判据，不是芯部的：本仓连边界都没有，所以它眼下是一份**记下来待有能力再比**的参考，不是可评的验收。",
      "outer_upstream_J38": "Te/Ti = 26.3 / 46.4 eV; ne = 0.50e13 cm^-3",
      "inner_upstream_J52": "Te/Ti = 27.9 / 45.9 eV; ne = 0.47e13 cm^-3",
      "outer_target": "Te/Ti = 0.96 / 1.00 eV; ne = 2.08e13 cm^-3",
      "inner_target": "Te/Ti = 1.18 / 1.23 eV; ne = 2.29e13 cm^-3",
      "power_channels_MW": "Pout / Pin / Prad = 0.117 / 0.110 / 0.414",
      "energy_residual_MW": "ion / electron = 4.76e-4 / 1.71e-3",
      "particle_residual_over_source": "5.7e-9",
      "counts": "267 JETTO outputs; 16 EIRENE calls; core snapshot ~295.788 s",
      "verdict": "INCOMPLETE — EDGE2D TIME = 3.510495 s, time-step stiffness; 作业 101624 / 101723，源文档判为**未完全通过**"
    },
    "fylite:note": "★★两重「跑不动」，要分开说。**本仓**跑不动，因为它整条判据都在 SOL / 偏滤器 / 中性粒子上，而本仓只有芯部。**源文档自己也没跑完**：EDGE2D 在 3.510495 s 撞上最小时间步（time-step stiffness）停住，而芯部快照已经推到约 295.788 s——所以这一档在源里也是 INCOMPLETE，它的表值是**一帧快照**，不是一个稳态解。★源文档原话记着这件事：「Snapshot evidence alone does not establish a stationary detached solution.」——照抄进来，免得下一个人把快照当成脱靶稳态的证据。",
    "fylite:note_en": "★★Two different「cannot run」, and they must be told apart. THIS REPOSITORY cannot run it because its whole acceptance lives in the SOL / divertor / neutrals and this repository has only the core. THE SOURCE DID NOT FINISH IT EITHER: EDGE2D stalled at its minimum time step (3.510495 s, time-step stiffness) while the core snapshot had advanced to ~295.788 s -- so the case is INCOMPLETE there too, and its tabulated values are ONE SNAPSHOT, not a steady solution. ★The source says so in its own words -- 'Snapshot evidence alone does not establish a stationary detached solution' -- copied here so the next reader does not take the snapshot for evidence of a detached steady state."
  },
